                      (../../defs/coco.d):00021         *
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00022         *          2003/11/05  Robert Gault
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00023         * Made changes in window globals and grfdrv memory to handle regW
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00024         * in 6809 systems.
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00025         *
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00026         *          2003/11/30  Boisy G. Pitre
