                      (../../defs/coco.d):00087                             IFEQ      PwrLnFrq-Hz50
0040                  (../../defs/coco.d):00088         TkPerSec            SET       50
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00089                             ELSE
     003C             (../../defs/coco.d):00090         TkPerSec            SET       60
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00091                             ENDC
