                      (../../defs/coco.d):00181         * NitrOS-9 Level 1 Section
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00182         *
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00183         *************************************************
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00184         
0004                  (../../defs/coco.d):00185         HW.Page             SET       $FF                 Device descriptor hardware page
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00186         
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00187                             ELSE
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00188         
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00189         *************************************************
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00190         *
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00191         * NitrOS-9 Level 2 Section
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00192         *
