                      (    cssnames3.asm):00038         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00039         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00040         *******************************************
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00041         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00042         * name changer for OS/9
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00043         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00044         * performs a high speed character string
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00045         * replacement. word pairs to be swapped
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00046         * are read from a wordlist path. program
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00047         * is most useful for changes that must
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00048         * be done often, paths larger than memory,
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00049         * or when the number of pairs is large.
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00050         * the original paths are not destroyed.
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00051         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00052         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00053         * calling format:
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00054         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00055         *    chgnam oldpath newpath wordlist #nnK
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00056         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00057         * oldpath is the path to be processed.
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00058         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00059         * newpath is the destination path that
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00060         * will be created.
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00061         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00062         * wordlist contains substitution word list
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00063         * containing pairs of words separated by
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00064         * a period. alternately the word pair can be
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00065         * preceeded, separated, and followed by a
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00066         * non-alphanumeric delimiter. this allows
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00067         * swapping words that contain a period. the
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00068         * maximum total characters (not including
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00069         * delimiters) in a word pair is 32. this
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00070         * is set during assembly by wpsize equ xx.
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00071         * this number must be a power of two.
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00072         * a few wordlist examples follow:
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00073         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00074         * old.new      (replace old with new)
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00075         * apple.pear   (lower case accepted)
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00076         * aPpLe.pear   (note case must be exact}
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00077         * " i " me "   (spaces isolate letter)
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00078         * .zB406.fms.  (used by super sleuth)
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00079         * /1.23/abcd/  (period part of word)
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00080         * eliminate    (change word to nothing)
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00081         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00082         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00083         * #nnK is an optional parameter used to
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00084         * increase the OS/9 allocation of memory
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00085         * for table space.  by default, about 10k
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00086         * is allocated.  the following message:
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00087         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00088         *   table overflow!
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00089         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00090         * is output to the terminal if insufficient
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00091         * space is allocated for the wordlist path.
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00092         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00093         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00094         *******************************************
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00095         *
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00096         * equates
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00097         *
     0020             (    cssnames3.asm):00098         wpsize              equ       $20                 change with caution! (power of 2)
     00E0             (    cssnames3.asm):00099         mask                equ       $100-wpsize
     2000             (    cssnames3.asm):00100         tabsiz              equ       $2000               table size default
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00101         **
     0000             (    cssnames3.asm):00102         iobfc               equ       0                   function code
     0001             (    cssnames3.asm):00103         iobba               equ       1                   buffer address
     0003             (    cssnames3.asm):00104         iobbl               equ       3                   buffer length
     0005             (    cssnames3.asm):00105         iobfd               equ       5                   path descriptor
     0007             (    cssnames3.asm):00106         iobca               equ       7                   next char address
     0009             (    cssnames3.asm):00107         iobcc               equ       9                   char counter
     0010             (    cssnames3.asm):00108         iobfn               equ       16                  path name
     0040             (    cssnames3.asm):00109         ioblen              equ       64                  length of i/o block
     0030             (    cssnames3.asm):00110         fnmlen              equ       ioblen-iobfn        length of path name
     0100             (    cssnames3.asm):00111         buflen              equ       256                 length of i/o buffer
     0001             (    cssnames3.asm):00112         read                equ       1                   read block raw
     0002             (    cssnames3.asm):00113         rdln                equ       2                   read block edited
     0003             (    cssnames3.asm):00114         write               equ       3                   write block raw
     0004             (    cssnames3.asm):00115         wrln                equ       4                   write block edited
                      (    cssnames3.asm):00116         **
