0012.                 (    cssnames3.asm):00130         donflg              rmb       1                   path done
0013.                 (    cssnames3.asm):00131         dupflg              rmb       1                   duplicate word
0014.                 (    cssnames3.asm):00132         delim               rmb       1                   word pair delimiter
